{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/4ba262cdbc8be191fbee6d8524509aca.poster.avif?t=1755248517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/4ba262cdbc8be191fbee6d8524509aca.webm?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/424005c9a15ecce1db809c5c544f48d6.poster.avif?t=1755248517\" width=616 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/424005c9a15ecce1db809c5c544f48d6.webm?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/424005c9a15ecce1db809c5c544f48d6.mp4?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Beat Brush is a cozy game where you draw music. Every stroke becomes sound. You\u2019re creating a melody \u2014 even if you\u2019ve never touched an instrument before. No stress, no pressure \u2014 just you, your brush, and the music that follows. Take a breath. I know how heavy things can feel sometimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/49162ff52a25cf1e2b499ab2164b404d.poster.avif?t=1755248517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/49162ff52a25cf1e2b499ab2164b404d.webm?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/060652be20f9bd3f0cefe71e707b85c1.poster.avif?t=1755248517\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/060652be20f9bd3f0cefe71e707b85c1.webm?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/060652be20f9bd3f0cefe71e707b85c1.mp4?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You\u2019ve never played anything like this. It\u2019s not a rhythm game \u2014 it\u2019s part musical improvisation, part visual expression. Like picking up an instrument \u2014 without needing to know how. Like art therapy \u2014 without needing to know how to draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/acff1fcc8b0167bcc7862831b7e68ff9.poster.avif?t=1755248517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/acff1fcc8b0167bcc7862831b7e68ff9.webm?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/5dbb8b9a399eee000fb0369ce5f958cf.poster.avif?t=1755248517\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/5dbb8b9a399eee000fb0369ce5f958cf.webm?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/5dbb8b9a399eee000fb0369ce5f958cf.mp4?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>This is a story about a girl who <strong><u>did everything right</u></strong> \u2014 and still burned out. Now she\u2019s trying to find her way back to herself through creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What makes Beat Brush special:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A one-of-a-kind mechanic: draw music in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 handcrafted levels, each with its own genre and art style \u2014 from pixel scenes to Ghibli-like dreamscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instruments to paint with: pianos, theremins, lo-fi pads, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle arcade and puzzle moments that guide, not challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet narrative about burnout, ambition, and healing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/82a4544177527edc30b4c3524c465bc3.avif?t=1755248517\" width=188 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My dad always said, \u201cA talented person can do anything&quot;.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I just wish he\u2019d also said, \u201cYou don\u2019t have to do everything&quot;.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3780050?t=1755248517","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/023d723e485e11ac80faea1ee987a25a8707e9d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755248517","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/2ac0c00b188f944181eebd58af2d603495a96850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755248517","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/2ac0c00b188f944181eebd58af2d603495a96850/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755248517","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/4ba262cdbc8be191fbee6d8524509aca.poster.avif?t=1755248517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/4ba262cdbc8be191fbee6d8524509aca.webm?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/424005c9a15ecce1db809c5c544f48d6.poster.avif?t=1755248517\" width=616 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/424005c9a15ecce1db809c5c544f48d6.webm?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/424005c9a15ecce1db809c5c544f48d6.mp4?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Beat Brush is a cozy game where you draw music. Every stroke becomes sound. You\u2019re creating a melody \u2014 even if you\u2019ve never touched an instrument before. No stress, no pressure \u2014 just you, your brush, and the music that follows. Take a breath. I know how heavy things can feel sometimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/49162ff52a25cf1e2b499ab2164b404d.poster.avif?t=1755248517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/49162ff52a25cf1e2b499ab2164b404d.webm?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/060652be20f9bd3f0cefe71e707b85c1.poster.avif?t=1755248517\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/060652be20f9bd3f0cefe71e707b85c1.webm?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/060652be20f9bd3f0cefe71e707b85c1.mp4?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You\u2019ve never played anything like this. It\u2019s not a rhythm game \u2014 it\u2019s part musical improvisation, part visual expression. Like picking up an instrument \u2014 without needing to know how. Like art therapy \u2014 without needing to know how to draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/acff1fcc8b0167bcc7862831b7e68ff9.poster.avif?t=1755248517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/acff1fcc8b0167bcc7862831b7e68ff9.webm?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/5dbb8b9a399eee000fb0369ce5f958cf.poster.avif?t=1755248517\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/5dbb8b9a399eee000fb0369ce5f958cf.webm?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/5dbb8b9a399eee000fb0369ce5f958cf.mp4?t=1755248517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>This is a story about a girl who <strong><u>did everything right</u></strong> \u2014 and still burned out. Now she\u2019s trying to find her way back to herself through creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What makes Beat Brush special:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A one-of-a-kind mechanic: draw music in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 handcrafted levels, each with its own genre and art style \u2014 from pixel scenes to Ghibli-like dreamscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instruments to paint with: pianos, theremins, lo-fi pads, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle arcade and puzzle moments that guide, not challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet narrative about burnout, ambition, and healing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/82a4544177527edc30b4c3524c465bc3.avif?t=1755248517\" width=188 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My dad always said, \u201cA talented person can do anything&quot;.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I just wish he\u2019d also said, \u201cYou don\u2019t have to do everything&quot;.</i></p>","developers":["Kesha Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/8e0a89097b744853e6a0426b6266ff55ef646d98/header.jpg?t=1755248517","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br>